msgstr "Передбачена мова для символів CJK:"

#. Translators: Label of the choice of the language assumed for Arabic letters.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/detection.py:69
msgid "Language assumed for arabic characters:"
msgstr "Передбачена мова для арабських символів:"

#. Translators: Label of the choice of the language assumed for Cyrillic letters.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/detection.py:71
msgid "Language assumed for cyrillic characters:"
msgstr "Передбачена мова для кириличних символів:"

#. Translators: Label of the choice of the language assumed for Devanagari letters.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/detection.py:73
msgid "Language assumed for devanagari characters:"
msgstr "Передбачена мова для символів деванагарі:"

#. Translators: Title of a setting dialog.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:20
msgid "Speech Engine"
msgstr "Синтезатор мовлення"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:26
msgid "Please select one or more speech engines to enable."
msgstr "Будь ласка, виберіть один або кілька синтезаторів, щоб увімкнути."

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:33
msgid "Select Speech Engines to Enable"
msgstr "Виберіть синтезатори, щоб увімкнути"

#. Translators: The message displayed
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:59
msgid ""
"Changes to speech-engine settings can’t be saved because no speech engine is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Зміни в налаштуваннях мови не можна зберегти, оскільки жоден синтезатор "
"мовлення не ввімкнено."

#. Translators: The title of the dialog
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:61
msgid "No Speech Engine Enabled"
msgstr "Жодного синтезатора мовлення не ввімкнено"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:70
msgid ""
"To enable or disable the speech engine, NVDA needs to save your "
"configuration and restart. Would you like to restart now?"
msgstr ""
"Щоб увімкнути або вимкнути синтезатор мовлення, NVDA потрібно зберегти "
"конфігурацію та перезавантажитися. Хочете перезавантажити зараз?"

#. Translators: The title of the dialog
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/engine.py:73
msgid "Speech Engine Change"
msgstr "Змінити синтезатор мовлення"

#. Translators: Label for the pipeline log switch of a speech pipeline stage.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/log.py:19
msgid "Apply speech dictionaries"
msgstr "Застосувати мовні словники"

#. Translators: Label for the pipeline log switch of a speech pipeline stage.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/log.py:21
msgid "Speech viewer"
msgstr "Переглядач мовлення"

#. Translators: Title of a setting dialog.
#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/log.py:31
msgid "Log Record"
msgstr "Запис журналу"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/log.py:40
msgid "Enable logging of WorldVoice’s speech pipeline"
msgstr "Увімкнути журнал мовлення WorldVoice"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/log.py:44
msgid "Select Speech Pipelines to Enable"
msgstr "Виберіть мовні процеси для активації"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/pipeline.py:25
msgid "Speech Pipeline"
msgstr "Мовлення"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:27
msgid "Speech Role"
msgstr "Роль мовлення"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:60
msgid "Select a language, and then configure the voice to be used:"
msgstr "Виберіть мову, а потім налаштуйте голос, який буде використовуватися:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:65
msgid "Locale Name:"
msgstr "Назва мови:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:70
msgid "Voice Name:"
msgstr "Назва голосу:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:72
msgid "Variant:"
msgstr "Варіант:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:76
msgid "&Rate:"
msgstr "&Швидкість:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:87
msgid "Rate boost"
msgstr "Підвищення швидкості"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:93
msgid "&Pitch:"
msgstr "&Висота:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:103
msgid "I&nflection:"
msgstr "&Інтонація:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:113
msgid "V&olume:"
msgstr "&Гучність:"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:126
msgid "Keep main engine and locale engine consistent"
msgstr "Зберігати узгодженість основного та додаткового синтезаторів"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:134
msgid "Keep main speech role and locale speech role consistent"
msgstr "Зберігати узгодженість основної й додаткової мовної ролі"

#: addon/globalPlugins/WorldVoice/panels/role.py:142
msgid "Keep parameter settings consistent between different speech roles"
msgstr "Зберігати однакові налаштування для різних мовних ролей"

#. Translators: Label for a setting in voice settings dialog, right above Voice: the speech engine
#. whose voices the Voice list and the settings ring offer. Choosing one switches to a voice of
#. that engine. Kept short like NVDA's own Voice and Variant labels.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/__init__.py:131
msgid "&Engine"
msgstr "Р&ушій"

#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/__init__.py:153
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/__init__.py:156
msgid "Detect language based on Unicode characters"
msgstr "Виявити мову на основі символів Unicode"

#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/__init__.py:471
msgid "default"
msgstr "стандартно"

#. Translators: A choice of the Speech Pipeline panel's effect scope: every synthesizer.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:37
msgid "All Synthesizers (Global)"
msgstr "Усі синтезатори (глобально)"

#. Translators: A choice of the Speech Pipeline panel's effect scope: WorldVoice only.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:39
msgid "Only WorldVoice Synthesizer"
msgstr "Тільки синтезатор WorldVoice"

#. Translators: A number mode: numbers are left as they are.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:45
msgid "off"
msgstr "не обробляти"

#. Translators: A number mode: a number is read as a value, for example "one hundred twenty-three".
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:47
msgid "value"
msgstr "цілі числа"

#. Translators: A number mode: the digits of a number are read one by one.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:49
msgid "number"
msgstr "по цифрах"

#. Translators: A number mode: the digits of a number are read in groups of the chosen size, counted from the left.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:51
msgid "group"
msgstr "групами"

#. Translators: A number language choice: numbers are read in the language of the text around them.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:57
msgid "Follow surrounding text language"
msgstr "Слідувати мові навколишнього тексту"

#. Translators: A number language choice: numbers are read in the main language, the language the
#. document marks or the main voice's language.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:60
msgid "Follow main language"
msgstr "Слідувати основній мові"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:149
msgid "Effect scope"
msgstr "Область дії"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:157
msgid "Global wait factor"
msgstr "Загальна пауза очікування"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:170
msgid "Number &language"
msgstr "&Мова цифр"

#. Translators: Label for a setting in synth settings ring; also the label of the setting's
#. pipeline log switch in the Log Record panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:173
msgid "Number language"
msgstr "Мова цифр"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:184
msgid "Number &mode"
msgstr "&Режим цифр"

#. Translators: Label for a setting in synth settings ring; also the label of the setting's
#. pipeline log switch in the Log Record panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:187
msgid "Number mode"
msgstr "Режим цифр"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:198
msgid "Group size"
msgstr "Розмір групи"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel;
#. also the label of the setting's pipeline log switch in the Log Record panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:215
msgid "Number wait factor"
msgstr "Пауза між цифрами"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel;
#. also the label of the setting's pipeline log switch in the Log Record panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:225
msgid "Item wait factor"
msgstr "Пауза між елементами"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:234
msgid "Say all wait factor"
msgstr "Пауза між елементами в режимі читати все"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel;
#. also the label of the setting's pipeline log switch in the Log Record panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:244
msgid "Space wait factor between CJK and Southeast Asian characters"
msgstr "Пауза для пробілів між символами CJK і Південно-Східної Азії"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:253
msgid "Enable punctuation pause control"
msgstr "Увімкнути керування паузами на розділових знаках"

#. Translators: Label for a setting in synth settings ring.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:255
msgid "Punctuation pauses"
msgstr "Паузи на розділових знаках"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:264
msgid "Remove configured punctuation at pause points"
msgstr "Видаляти вказані розділові знаки в місцях пауз"

#. Translators: Label for a setting in synth settings ring.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:266
msgid "Remove punctuation at pause points"
msgstr "Видаляти розділові знаки в місцях пауз"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel;
#. also the label of the setting's pipeline log switch in the Log Record panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:277
msgid "Punctuation wait factor"
msgstr "Пауза на розділових знаках"

#. Translators: Label for a pipeline setting in the voice settings panel and the Speech Pipeline panel.
#: addon/synthDrivers/WorldVoice/pipeline/settings.py:286
msgid "Punctuation pause characters"
msgstr "Розділові знаки для пауз"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid ""
"Multilingual synthesizer add-on: auto-switches voices across eSpeak, "
"OneCore, SAPI5 & RHVoice based on text language."
msgstr ""
"Багатомовний синтезатор: автоматичне перемикання голосів між eSpeak, "
"OneCore, SAPI5 та RHVoice на основі мови тексту."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid "Punctuation pauses, more number reading modes, and an Engine list to group voices by engine."
msgstr "Паузи на розділових знаках, більше режимів читання чисел і список «Рушій» для групування голосів за рушієм."
